program RopeTool
arg -h
status 0
output
ropetool [options] command arguments...

  -h, --help
      Display help message and exit.

cat A B  Print the concatenation of A and B.


sub S START LEN  Print the substring of S from START, LEN characters.


len S  Print the length of S.


fetch S I  Print the character of S at index I.


cmp A B  Print -1, 0 or 1: how A compares to B.


find S PATTERN FROM  Print the index of PATTERN in S at or after FROM, or -1.


repeat S N  Print N concatenated copies of S.
